            "source:953020689aaad9177696c28b",
            "source:b2514a4b6238ddb4ce41c39c"
          ],
          "text": "Onyxia is Deathwing’s daughter and Nefarian’s twin. Windsor identifies her as Lady Prestor and blames her for manipulating Stormwind and its Highlord. In her Dustwallow lair she fiercely guards her clutch and regards mortals as inferior prey. Fighting bores her, and she threatens to incinerate intruders from above. Reports connect her brood to the invasion of Stonemaul Village while questioning why she came there.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 10184
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
